---
const ADDRESS = 'Rua Júlio Rocha, 388 - Araturi, Caucaia - CE, 61655-490';
const MAPS_EMBED = `https://www.google.com/maps?q=${encodeURIComponent(ADDRESS)}&output=embed`;
const MAPS_LINK = 'https://share.google/A8V2hZY1sKLtMXcMK';
---

<section id="localizacao" class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-sand-50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 grid lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] gap-10 items-center">
    <div>
      <div class="reveal-line">
        <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ember-700">
          <span class="reveal-line-bar block h-0.5 w-8 bg-ember-500"></span>
          Onde estamos
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-charcoal-900 leading-tight">
          Base em Caucaia, atendendo o Ceará inteiro
        </h2>
      </div>

      <p class="reveal mt-4 text-charcoal-600 leading-relaxed" style="animation-delay: 80ms">
        A locação cobre um raio de até 250km a partir da nossa sede — na prática, todo o estado.
        Para venda, entregamos por transportadora em qualquer lugar do Brasil.
      </p>

      <address class="reveal mt-6 not-italic text-charcoal-800 leading-relaxed" style="animation-delay: 120ms">
        Rua Júlio Rocha, 388 — Araturi<br />
        Caucaia - CE, 61655-490
      </address>

      <a
        href={MAPS_LINK}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="reveal mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-ember-700 hover:text-ember-800"
        style="animation-delay: 160ms"
      >
        Abrir no Google Maps →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal-rise rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-charcoal-900/10" style="animation-delay: 100ms">
      <iframe
        src={MAPS_EMBED}
        class="w-full h-[320px] sm:h-[400px]"
        style="border:0"
        loading="lazy"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
        title="Localização da BravoLoc em Caucaia, CE"
      ></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
